{"unit_id":"KshineKX__dsh-effort-slider#card-zh","repo":"KshineKX/dsh-effort-slider","commit":"076da69d175003661a7e5ef68dc2adf1c26b5034","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-slider 是一款面向 DSH 网页 composer 的推理强度与提示模式控制插件。它在模型栏提供滑杆和模型选择面板，可切换模型公开的推理档位，并按会话记住 Ultra 与 Fast 两种开关。Ultra 档在当前请求使用对应最高档位时向系统提示词加入可配置提示；Fast 开关独立加入速度优先提示。适合希望在会话中快速调整推理档位和提示行为的 DSH 网页用户；状态保存在本机 DSH home。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:701","index.js:84","lib/gate.js:71","lib/state.js:149"]}
{"unit_id":"KshineKX__dsh-effort-slider#card-en","repo":"KshineKX/dsh-effort-slider","commit":"076da69d175003661a7e5ef68dc2adf1c26b5034","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-effort-slider adds model and reasoning effort selection to the DSH web composer. It saves Ultra and Fast toggles per session. Ultra adds a configurable system prompt only at the selected top effort; Fast adds an independent speed focused prompt. State stays in the local DSH home directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:701","index.js:84","lib/gate.js:71","lib/state.js:149"]}
